<title>USA: Delphi to offer $100 mln capital securities.</title>
<headline>Delphi to offer $100 mln capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delphi Financial Group Inc said it would offer $100 million of 9.31 percent Series A Capital Securities.</p>
<p>Securities would be issued through its unit Delphi Funding LLC and would mature in 2027, it said.</p>
<p>Delphi said it would use proceeds to repay $50 million principal of revolving bank debt and for general corporate purposes. The offering was being underwritten by Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co. It was expected on March 25, the company said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
